%% Paper order lifecycle — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Created[CREATED] --> Authorized[AUTHORIZED]
  Created --> Rejected[REJECTED]
  Authorized --> Gate{Current capability and permission gates}
  Gate -->|Admitted| Submitting[SUBMITTING]
  Gate -->|Blocked| Block[No dispatch / preserve attempted-order recovery]
  Authorized --> Expired[EXPIRED / CANCELED if never attempted]
  Submitting --> Unknown[SUBMISSION_UNKNOWN]
  Unknown --> Reconcile[Query stable client ID / history]
  Reconcile --> Ack[ACKNOWLEDGED]
  Reconcile --> Partial[PARTIALLY_FILLED]
  Reconcile --> Filled[FILLED]
  Reconcile --> Rejected
  Submitting --> Ack
  Submitting --> Partial
  Submitting --> Filled
  Submitting --> Rejected
  Ack --> Partial
  Ack --> Filled
  Ack --> Cancel[CANCEL_PENDING]
  Partial --> Cancel
  Partial --> Filled
  Cancel --> Canceled[CANCELED confirmed remainder]
  Cancel --> Partial
  Cancel --> Filled
  Partial --> Ledger[Unique fill posting to Ledger]
  Filled --> Ledger
  Canceled --> Late[Late facts still reconcile]
  Late --> Ledger
